      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "We're whitelisting a method for Udon to allow world creators to dispose downloaded textures individually to better suit use cases like this one, as an alternative to disposing the entire downloader at once. Documentation will be updated.\n\nPlease note that it is still up to the world creator to release downloaded textures once they're no longer needed.",
